@baseUrl = http://localhost:5165
@user = master1
@roles = MasterMaintainer

### 得意先別商品単価一覧（asOf 時点・組み合わせごと1件）
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer-product-prices?asOf=2026-04-15
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 初回単価登録（新しい得意先・商品の組み合わせ）
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer-product-prices
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}
X-Dummy-Roles: {{roles}}

{
  "customerId": 1,
  "productId": 2,
  "unitPrice": 95,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-03-01"
}

### 指定日時点の単価情報
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer-product-prices/1/2?asOf=2026-04-15
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 単価変更履歴一覧
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer-product-prices/1/2/changes
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}

### 指定日からの単価変更
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customer-product-prices/1/2/changes
Content-Type: application/json
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}
X-Dummy-Roles: {{roles}}

{
  "unitPrice": 90,
  "effectiveFrom": "2026-06-01"
}

### 自動取得単価プレビュー
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customer-product-prices/preview?customerId=1&productId=2&asOf=2026-04-15
X-Dummy-User: {{user}}
